# Admin UI hybrid policy

## Default (required)

New and changed merchant admin UI in `app/` uses **`@shopify/polaris` React**:

- `Page`, `Layout`, `Card`, `BlockStack`, `InlineStack`, `InlineGrid`, `Box`
- `Text`, `Button`, `ButtonGroup`, `TextField`, `Select`, `Checkbox`, `ChoiceList`
- `Modal`, `Popover`, `ActionList`, `Banner`, `Badge`, `IndexTable`, `EmptyState`
- App Bridge React: `NavMenu`, `TitleBar`, `Modal` (`variant="max"` for the survey editor), `useAppBridge()` toasts

Source of truth: [Polaris React Storybook](https://storybook.polaris.shopify.dev/) and [npm `@shopify/polaris`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@shopify/polaris).

## Allowed Web Components (opt-in only)

Keep `@shopify/polaris-types` and App Home / App Bridge web components installed. Use `s-*` **only** when React Polaris or App Bridge React has no equivalent (platform shell APIs). Document each leftover with:

```tsx
// App Home WC: reason
```

Do **not** mix WC and React Polaris in the same form or card. Editor dense layouts use React Polaris + CSS modules (`editor-chrome.module.css`), not WC + custom CSS overrides.

## Out of scope

Checkout UI extensions (`extensions/thank-you-survey/`) stay on `@shopify/ui-extensions`. Never import `@shopify/polaris` there.
